    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21628505
    description: Zenodo concept DOI (resolves to the latest archived version)
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - quantum machine learning
  - variational quantum eigensolver
  - VQE
  - QAOA
  - PennyLane
  - JAX
  - antiferromagnetism
  - antiferromagnetic Hamiltonians
  - kagome lattice
  - Mn3Sn
  - spintronics
  - spin-orbit torque
  - spin Hall effect
  - entanglement
  - exact diagonalization
  - DMRG
  - TeNPy
  - hardware-efficient ansatz
  - MERA
abstract: >-
  spinq-vqe provides PennyLane-based variational quantum eigensolver (VQE) and
  QAOA workflows for Kagome antiferromagnets and spin-orbit-torque material
  screening, with exact-diagonalization and TeNPy DMRG benchmarks, entanglement
  diagnostics, and reproducible notebooks.
